From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:07:22 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): opt-in turns for background completions with
 no viewer

sessions.unviewed_completion_turns (default 0) runs a notify_on_complete
process exit or a background subagent's result for a local session with
no viewer as an agent turn instead of a note, at most N in a row (one
count for both). A viewer attaching or a user message resets the count;
a chat closed by exit or /new, or a subagent whose dispatching session
is refused, keeps notes.

Refs #143649.
